# Brian Webb

## About Me

I'm currently a software developer with an interest in building tools that
help scientists. I've held a lot of jobs over the years including waiter, bartender,
landscaper, lecturer, and bench scientist.

I've tried to start a blog multiple times in the past, but never felt comfortable
sharing thoughts in public. But I'm convinced that sharing in public is important,
so here's the latest attempt.

On weekends you can almost always find me taking a long walk.
